  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lusaka Transmission Distribution Rehabilitation Project - Women Empowerment and Micro Small Enterprise Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This action focuses on enabling women benefitting from the subsidised electricity connections and those already connected to electricity services in the Lusaka Transmission Distribution Rehabilitation Project (LTDRP) target areas of Lusaka to have increased access to complementary services including credit facilities, business management and entrepreneurial skills training&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
